<title>USA: Rhone-Poulenc Rorer sets 5 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer sets 5 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>COLLEGEVILLE, Pa. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer Inc said Thursday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to five million shares.</p>
<p>The company earlier reported first quarter earnings of $0.41 per share on 136.8 million average common shares outstanding.  The first quarter earnings last year were $0.55 per share.</p>
</text>
